      <memberdef kind="function" id="namespace_marmot_1_1_testing_1aada80ec024a9dbc01b7b9f2984799b1a" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="yes" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void Marmot::Testing::checkAbsoluteStiffnessBoundAgainstStiffness</definition>
        <argsstring>(const std::string &amp;name, Marmot::Discretizations::Meshfree::Particle &amp;particle, const Eigen::MatrixXd &amp;K, const Eigen::MatrixXd &amp;W, double maxOverestimate)</argsstring>
        <name>checkAbsoluteStiffnessBoundAgainstStiffness</name>
        <qualifiedname>Marmot::Testing::checkAbsoluteStiffnessBoundAgainstStiffness</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const std::string &amp;</type>
          <declname>name</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_meshfree_1_1_particle" kindref="compound">Marmot::Discretizations::Meshfree::Particle</ref> &amp;</type>
          <declname>particle</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const Eigen::MatrixXd &amp;</type>
          <declname>K</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const Eigen::MatrixXd &amp;</type>
          <declname>W</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>double</type>
          <declname>maxOverestimate</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Check the bound of <formula id="78">$ |\boldsymbol{K}|\, \boldsymbol{W} $</formula> of a particle (<ref refid="_marmot_particle_stiffness_visitors_8h_1a3d65119bd6c2ee382e8727acb4941ebe" kindref="member">Marmot::Discretizations::Meshfree::addBoundOfAbsoluteStiffnessTimes()</ref>) against its stiffness  <formula id="79">$ \boldsymbol{K}
$</formula>: the bound never lies below <formula id="78">$ |\boldsymbol{K}|\, \boldsymbol{W} $</formula>, and the largest entry of each column (what the Collatz-Wielandt bound takes) is at most <computeroutput>maxOverestimate</computeroutput> times the exact one. The stiffness the particle describes, assembled (<ref refid="_marmot_particle_stiffness_visitors_8h_1ad37467af1b4bb17a958c394b9b7652e5" kindref="member">Marmot::Discretizations::Meshfree::assembleStiffness()</ref>), is <computeroutput>K</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>name</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The name of the particle, for the messages. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>particle</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The particle, at the state of <computeroutput>K</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>K</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The stiffness of the particle at a zero increment, column-major, nDof x nDof. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>W</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The nonnegative weights, nDof x nColumns. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>maxOverestimate</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The largest admissible ratio of the largest entries of a column. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<parameterlist kind="exception"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>std::runtime_error</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>(throwExceptionOnFailure()) if the bound fails either check. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
