      <memberdef kind="function" id="namespace_marmot_1_1_testing_1a0b08cdac780fdfcc7b2673706116c8cd" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="yes" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void Marmot::Testing::checkUpdatingTheShapeFunctionsEqualsAssigningTheKernelFunctionsAgain</definition>
        <argsstring>(const std::string &amp;name, Marmot::Discretizations::Meshfree::Particle &amp;particle, const std::vector&lt; const Marmot::Discretizations::Meshfree::KernelFunction * &gt; &amp;kernelFunctions, std::vector&lt; double &gt; &amp;stateVars, const Eigen::VectorXd &amp;dQ)</argsstring>
        <name>checkUpdatingTheShapeFunctionsEqualsAssigningTheKernelFunctionsAgain</name>
        <qualifiedname>Marmot::Testing::checkUpdatingTheShapeFunctionsEqualsAssigningTheKernelFunctionsAgain</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const std::string &amp;</type>
          <declname>name</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_meshfree_1_1_particle" kindref="compound">Marmot::Discretizations::Meshfree::Particle</ref> &amp;</type>
          <declname>particle</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const std::vector&lt; const <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_meshfree_1_1_kernel_function" kindref="compound">Marmot::Discretizations::Meshfree::KernelFunction</ref> * &gt; &amp;</type>
          <declname>kernelFunctions</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>std::vector&lt; double &gt; &amp;</type>
          <declname>stateVars</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const Eigen::VectorXd &amp;</type>
          <declname>dQ</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Check updateShapeFunctions() of a particle that has moved: it evaluates the shape functions anew, and it evaluates the same as assigning the same kernel functions again. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The particle is advanced by the increment <computeroutput>dQ</computeroutput> and accepted (acceptStateAndPosition()), so that it moves, keeping its kernel functions. The residual and the tangent of the trial increment <computeroutput>dQ</computeroutput> (computePhysicsKernels()) are then compared, after updateShapeFunctions() and after assignMeshfreeKernelFunctions() with <computeroutput>kernelFunctions</computeroutput>, to the last bit; and with the residual before the update, which is of the shape functions of the old configuration and must differ. The state variables are restored after every trial. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>name</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The name of the particle, for the messages. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>particle</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The particle, with <computeroutput>kernelFunctions</computeroutput> assigned. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>kernelFunctions</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Its kernel functions. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>stateVars</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Its state variables. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>dQ</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>An increment of its nodes, node-wise. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<parameterlist kind="exception"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>std::runtime_error</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>(throwExceptionOnFailure()) if the update does not evaluate the shape functions anew, or evaluates other ones than the assignment. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
